title: "XPS Fit Studio"
abstract: "A free, browser-based tool for X-ray photoelectron spectroscopy (XPS) data processing: VAMAS import, binding-energy calibration, Shirley and Tougaard backgrounds, Gaussian–Lorentzian and asymmetric line shapes, χ² statistics with parameter uncertainties, RSF quantification and Excel export."
type: software
